{
	"_about": "AFFALTER CLK DTM: its race display on the column top is its own picture (Image_6, 512 x 256 px: a grey LCD with empty frames labelled Fuel total, speed, gear, Laptime, Session, Modes; the screen's UVs a tile over: uv_wrap). Made live in its frames: the fuel in litres, the speed, the gear, the lap time, the clock in Session. Its own LED bar over the screen (RPMBAR1: 50 segments, told apart by where they sit) climbs with the revs, green, then yellow, then red, and the five shift lights above it (RPM_LED) come on in turn near the limiter. Pixels of the picture; LEDs: their centres in the model's axes (x), their row's band (y). A few of the steering wheel's plastic pieces, left in the body by the model's cut, are moved onto it (wheel_parts: within its disc, 16.7 cm round its axis, 4.5 cm either side of its plane).",
